  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two flasks I and II shown below are connected by a valve of negligible volume.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0024_18d32f03e60b.png\" style=\"width: 372px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>When the valve is opened, the final pressure of the system in bar is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;is (Integer answer)<br />[Assume : Ideal gas; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> bar <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pa</mi></math> : Molar mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "84",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Applying ; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>II</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>initial</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>The final number of moles.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>II</mi></math>&nbsp;are the number of moles of gas in each container.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Assuming the system attains a final temperature of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> (such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>60</mn></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mo>&#8739;</mo></mfenced></math> Heat lost by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> of container <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo></math> Heat gained by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> of container <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">}</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mfenced close=\"\"><mrow><mn>300</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>II</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>28</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>28</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>284</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> (final temperature)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> If the final pressure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mi>final</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>28</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi>RT</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>II</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>gm</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>28</mn><mi>gm</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>31</mn><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mrow><mi>mol</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>284</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mfrac><mi>bar</mi><mi>Pa</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>84287</mn><mi>bar</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>bar</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>84</mn></math></p>"
